#   "Thirty-three compounds came out of the packaging; what the instrument
#    recorded is thirty-three peaks -- a retention time, a fragment ion, and
#    a formula that thousands of structures share."
#
# Con el panel A delante, eso es falso en la propia pagina: lo que un
# instrumento registra son ~1.653 features. Sustituir por:
